# Copy to config/marvin_capture.json and edit, or set MARVIN_CAPTURE_CONFIG.
# OAuth desktop client JSON goes in config/gmail_credentials.json (gitignored via *.env / secrets patterns).
# After first auth, token is written to config/gmail_token.json — keep it private.

# Optional overrides (paths relative to repo root are fine in the JSON file):
# MARVIN_CAPTURE_CONFIG=/absolute/path/to/marvin_capture.json
